{"name": "Box or Void", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Box or Void is a puzzle game about reversing positive and negative space. The obstacles in one space become pathways for the other. Move the characters and push boxes to change the layout of the levels. Master this duality and explore worlds with new mechanics that build on this core idea.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Reverse the Space</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">White walks on black and black walks on white. Switch between the spaces and characters you are controlling to solve the impossible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878040/extras/178dce8cd363f92cdb9486691df2eba1.poster.avif?t=1784032297\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878040/extras/178dce8cd363f92cdb9486691df2eba1.webm?t=1784032297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878040/extras/178dce8cd363f92cdb9486691df2eba1.mp4?t=1784032297\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore the Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This simple idea opens up tons of possibilities. Explore 160+ levels to see how it adds to the classic Sokoban formula.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878040/extras/b71c256c0a049844a8a652b54049c755.poster.avif?t=1784032297\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878040/extras/b71c256c0a049844a8a652b54049c755.webm?t=1784032297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878040/extras/b71c256c0a049844a8a652b54049c755.mp4?t=1784032297\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">New Worlds &amp; New Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each themed world introduces a new twist based on the core idea. See how these mechanics interacts with each other to create surprising puzzles. More worlds are coming soon! <br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878040/extras/7a47c1a4fcd8004b57d13e9250138f1d.poster.avif?t=1784032297\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878040/extras/7a47c1a4fcd8004b57d13e9250138f1d.webm?t=1784032297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878040/extras/7a47c1a4fcd8004b57d13e9250138f1d.mp4?t=1784032297\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878040/extras/a514675446e482278dd17345139acc58.poster.avif?t=1784032297\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878040/extras/a514675446e482278dd17345139acc58.webm?t=1784032297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878040/extras/a514675446e482278dd17345139acc58.mp4?t=1784032297\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Walls become empty space. Empty space becomes walls. Box or Void is a puzzle game about reversing positive and negative space. Obstacles in one space become pathways in the other.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878040/778374e2d5edf69024a4df7825c3cc5fafac12de/header.jpg?t=1784032297", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Puzzle", "Sokoban", "Logic", "Casual", "Minimalist", "Abstract"], "developers": "Dumen Games", "publishers": "Dumen Games", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3878040", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "28 January 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/n8B8TBLHRrU", "first_seen": 1769558400.0, "review_rank": 1318}